      "question": "Attachments",
      "preferredVariantId": "v-c36aa19207",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-c36aa19207",
          "answer": "Flexor carpi ulnaris inserts here; gives attachment to pisohamate and pisometacarpal ligaments and abductor digiti minimi.",
